5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We need a sustainable system. I want to understand the actual time commitment and how we define ""done"" to avoid misunderstandings.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. It feels as though the burden isn't shared proportionally to usage. I'd like to see the actual patterns of use and presence.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I just want the rooms to be clean all the time! Why is the bathroom so scary sometimes? I want to know why it gets dirty.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It would be lovely to have a clear plan. I am also curious about the costs of our supplies and how we handle the billing.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,Let us be mindful of our harmony. I am interested in the history of our disagreements and how previous tenants handled this.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, that makes sense. If we have the data, we can build a fairer model.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely. Logic should dictate the arrangement, not just a coin toss.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Can we look at the notes the old people left? Maybe they had a secret trick!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a wonderful idea, Sakura dear.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,Indeed. Learning from the past is the surest way to protect our future friendship.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
