35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"It turns out the time varies wildly by room, and our standards for ""done"" are completely inconsistent. This explains the friction.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"My findings confirm my suspicions. Usage is heavily skewed, and some of us are barely here while others are constant residents.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,The bathroom gets moldy really fast because of the window! And some people just wipe the sink and call it a day!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I found we are spending quite a bit on supplies, often buying duplicates, and the billing process for professional help is a bit clunky.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The previous tenants tried permanent assignments, but it ruined their friendship. Our arguments always stem from reminders. We must avoid that.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"If we have different standards, a fixed rota might just lead to more arguments about quality.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,And a rota ignores the fact that some people use the kitchen ten times more than others. It's logically unsound.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,I don't want to argue! I just want it to be clean. Maybe a professional could do it?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"A professional would be very thorough, though we must ensure the cost is split fairly and transparently.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,A professional removes the need for us to remind one another. That protects our peace of mind.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"A professional service would remove the time burden entirely, which is my main concern.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It would certainly solve the ""usage vs. work"" disparity. The cost is a flat fee regardless of who cooks.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,Yes! No more scary bathrooms!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I can help keep track of the receipts so no one is left out of pocket.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,It seems the most harmonious path. It replaces interpersonal conflict with a simple financial transaction.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
